Package: fastcramer
Type: Package
Title: Fast Cramér Multivariate Two-Sample Statistic and Permutation Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexander C.", "Furnas", email = "zfurnas@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Computes the Cramér multivariate two-sample statistic of Baringhaus and
    Franz (2004) <doi:10.1016/S0047-259X(03)00079-4> exactly as the 'cramer' package does,
    but from three mean pairwise distances evaluated with BLAS matrix products and a fused
    C++ pass, which is roughly a thousand times faster and scales to thousands of
    observations per sample. Provides the statistic for all five kernels of 'cramer', a
    label-permutation test with optional strata, and a bootstrap-versus-blocked-null
    design for very large samples.
